## Common Examples

The following code shows the steps to transmit a string of characters.

```cpp
int uart_tx_rdy() {
  return ((*UART_FIFO_STATUS_REG & UART_FIFO_STATUS_TXLVL_MASK) == 32) ? 0 : 1;
}

int uart_rcv_char() {
  if(uart_rx_empty())
    return -1;
  return *UART_RDATA_REG;
}
```

